{"nodes":[{"id":"title_real_subtypes_batch01","type":"text","text":"# 女性发型库总表｜真实网络参考子型批次 01\n\n**范围：马尾／短发／卷发／公主切／双马尾／狼尾**\n\n共 18 张公开美发与时尚资料图。每张保留原始来源文章链接，用于结构比对与角色设计参考；不使用生成图冒充行业资料。\n\n本 Canvas 是《女性发型库总表》的可编辑扩展批次，后续可继续追加丸子头、编发、半扎、盘发、长直发、水母头、侧剃等。","x":-550,"y":-850,"width":1100,"height":440,"color":"4"},{"id":"group_ponytail_batch01","type":"group","x":-2850,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"5","label":"02A｜马尾子型｜单束锚点差异"},{"id":"img_ponytail_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 高位紧束马尾｜High & Sleek\n\n![](https://media.allure.com/photos/5771a7a42554df47220a6aa4/master/w_1024%2Cc_limit/hair-ideas-2013-12-high-sleek-ponytail.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://www.allure.com/gallery/the-7-best-ponytail-hairstyles)","x":-2790,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},{"id":"img_ponytail_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 低位凌乱马尾｜Low & Messy\n\n![](https://media.allure.com/photos/5771a7a42554df47220a6aa7/master/w_1024%2Cc_limit/hair-ideas-2013-12-low-and-messy-ponytail.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://www.allure.com/gallery/the-7-best-ponytail-hairstyles)","x":-2230,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},{"id":"img_ponytail_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 松散侧马尾｜Loose Side Ponytail\n\n![](https://media.allure.com/photos/5771a7a72554df47220a6aac/master/w_1024%2Cc_limit/hair-ideas-2013-12-loose-side-ponytail.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://www.allure.com/gallery/the-7-best-ponytail-hairstyles)","x":-1670,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},{"id":"summary_ponytail_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 马尾结构差异\n\n- **高位紧束**：锚点靠近冠部，头皮方向集中、尾部上扬。\n- **低位凌乱**：锚点落在后颈，顶部与脸侧保留松量。\n- **侧马尾**：锚点偏离中轴，尾部越肩形成明显横向方向。\n\n同属单束扎发，但锚点高度、是否居中、根部张力至少有两项明显不同。","x":-2790,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":520,"color":"5"},{"id":"group_short_batch01","type":"group","x":-900,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"6","label":"03A｜短发子型｜长度与重量线"},{"id":"img_short_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 短卷波波头｜Curly Short Bob\n\n![](https://files.vogue.co.th/uploads/curly-hairstyle-short-bob1.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://vogue.co.th/beauty/article/hair-hairstyle-for-curly-hair)","x":-840,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"6"},{"id":"img_short_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 卷曲精灵短发｜Curly Pixie\n\n![](https://files.vogue.co.th/uploads/curly-hairstyle-pixie-cut.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://vogue.co.th/beauty/article/hair-hairstyle-for-curly-hair)","x":-280,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"6"},{"id":"img_short_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 碎束 Bixie｜Piece-y Bixie\n\n![](https://media.allure.com/photos/667203ffb62bd313e567dd2f/master/w_1600%2Cc_limit/piecey-bixie-1.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://www.allure.com/story/bixie-haircut-90s-bob-pixie-hairstyle-trend)","x":280,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"6"},{"id":"summary_short_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 短发结构差异\n\n- **短卷 Bob**：齐颌附近形成完整圆形／方圆外轮廓。\n- **Curly Pixie**：耳上与后颈明显缩短，顶部保留卷量。\n- **Bixie**：介于 Bob 与 Pixie 之间，周边略长、内部碎层明显。\n\n“短发”只是长度层，必须继续用重量线、耳颈暴露度和层次强度区分。","x":-840,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":520,"color":"6"},{"id":"group_curl_batch01","type":"group","x":1050,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"3","label":"04A｜卷发子型｜卷径与起卷位置"},{"id":"img_curl_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 短卷 Bob 纹理｜Short Curly Bob\n\n![](https://files.vogue.co.th/uploads/curly-hairstyle-short-bob1.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://vogue.co.th/beauty/article/hair-hairstyle-for-curly-hair)","x":1110,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"3"},{"id":"img_curl_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 中长自然卷｜Mid-Length Curly\n\n![](https://files.vogue.co.th/uploads/curly-hairstyle-mid-lenght.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://vogue.co.th/beauty/article/hair-hairstyle-for-curly-hair)","x":1670,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"3"},{"id":"img_curl_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 长卷发｜Long Curly Hair\n\n![](https://files.vogue.co.th/uploads/curly-long-hairstyle.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://vogue.co.th/beauty/article/hair-hairstyle-for-curly-hair)","x":2230,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"3"},{"id":"summary_curl_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 卷发结构差异\n\n- **短卷**：卷体被短轮廓托起，横向体量更强。\n- **中长卷**：肩颈处形成连续 S 波，兼顾蓬松与下垂。\n- **长卷**：卷组沿长轴重复，重力使下段更垂直。\n\n卷发属于纹理层，可与短发、狼尾、马尾等叠加；归类时不要把剪裁和卷度混成一件事。","x":1110,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":520,"color":"3"},{"id":"group_hime_batch01","type":"group","x":-2850,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"2","label":"05A｜公主切子型｜侧片断层"},{"id":"img_hime_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 经典长发公主切｜Classic Hime\n\n![](https://files.vogue.co.th/uploads/hime-cut-hairstyle_%2839%29.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://vogue.co.th/beauty/article/hair-hime-cut-idea)","x":-2790,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"2"},{"id":"img_hime_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 柔化侧片公主切｜Soft Hime\n\n![](https://files.vogue.co.th/uploads/hime-cut-hairstyle_%2821%29.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://vogue.co.th/beauty/article/hair-hime-cut-idea)","x":-2230,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"2"},{"id":"img_hime_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 多层侧片公主切｜Layered Hime\n\n![](https://files.vogue.co.th/uploads/hime-cut-hairstyle_%2823%29.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://vogue.co.th/beauty/article/hair-hime-cut-idea)","x":-1670,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"2"},{"id":"summary_hime_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 公主切结构差异\n\n- **经典型**：长直发主体＋两侧水平短片，断层最硬。\n- **柔化型**：侧片边缘轻薄或外翻，与主体过渡稍软。\n- **多层型**：脸侧出现两级以上平切长度，节奏更复杂。\n\n决定性证据是独立脸侧短片与长发主体之间的可见断层，不是普通脸周层次。","x":-2790,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":520,"color":"2"},{"id":"group_twintail_batch01","type":"group","x":-900,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"1","label":"06A｜双马尾子型｜双束与尾部处理"},{"id":"img_twintail_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 经典双马尾｜Classic Double Ponytail\n\n![](https://fashionuer.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/The-Classic-Double-Ponytail.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://fashionuer.com/beauty/hair/women/two-ponytail-hairstyle-ideas/)","x":-840,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},{"id":"img_twintail_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 泡泡双马尾｜Bubble Pigtails\n\n![](https://fashionuer.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Bubble-Ponytails.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://fashionuer.com/beauty/hair/women/two-ponytail-hairstyle-ideas/)","x":-280,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},{"id":"img_twintail_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 卷曲双马尾｜Curly Pigtails\n\n![](https://fashionuer.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Curly-Two-Ponytail-Hairstyle.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://fashionuer.com/beauty/hair/women/two-ponytail-hairstyle-ideas/)","x":280,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},{"id":"summary_twintail_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 双马尾结构差异\n\n- **经典型**：左右各一主束点，尾部自然垂落。\n- **泡泡型**：每条尾部再由多个等距束点分段。\n- **卷曲型**：双锚点保持不变，尾部纹理转为卷曲体量。\n\n双马尾首先由“左右两个主束点”定义，泡泡与卷曲是尾部二级变量。","x":-840,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":520,"color":"1"},{"id":"group_wolf_batch01","type":"group","x":1050,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"5","label":"07A｜狼尾子型｜上短下长层次"},{"id":"img_wolf_1_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 经典波纹狼尾｜Classic Wavy Wolf\n\n![](https://www.hair.com/dw/image/v2/AANG_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-hair-us-Library/default/dw91abfa40/blog/2023/wolf-cut-header.jpg?q=70&sh=200&sm=fit&sw=430)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://www.hair.com/wolf-cut-hair.html)","x":1110,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},{"id":"img_wolf_2_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 狼尾剪裁前后对照｜Wolf Cut Structure\n\n![](https://www.hair.com/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-hair-us-Library/default/dw53b37e83/blog/2023/wolf-cut-2.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://www.hair.com/wolf-cut-hair.html)","x":1670,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},{"id":"img_wolf_3_batch01","type":"text","text":"### 短中长层狼尾｜Layered Wolf Cut\n\n![](https://highxtar.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/highxtar-el-wolf-cut-es-el-corte-de-pelo-de-esta-temporada-1.jpg)\n\n[打开来源文章](https://highxtar.com/en/the-wolf-cut-is-this-seasons-haircut-of-the-season/)","x":2230,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},{"id":"summary_wolf_batch01","type":"text","text":"## 狼尾结构差异\n\n- **经典波纹狼尾**：顶部蓬松、脸周碎层、后段保留长度。\n- **剪裁对照**：可直接观察从单一长发到上短下长结构的变化。\n- **层次狼尾**：顶部短层与后颈长尾同时存在，外轮廓更断裂。\n\n只有“碎”不够；顶部短层与后颈长尾必须同时成立。","x":1110,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":520,"color":"5"},{"id":"audit_batch01","type":"text","text":"# 批次 01 审计\n\n- [x] 只使用真实网络资料图\n- [x] 每张图保留来源文章链接\n- [x] 马尾／短发／卷发／公主切／双马尾／狼尾各 3 张\n- [x] 不把模特表情、服装或背景当作发型结构\n- [x] 明确区分长度层、纹理层、扎束方式与剪裁结构\n\n## 下一批\n丸子头／双丸子、编发／麻花辫、半扎、盘发、长直发／齐切长发、水母头／鲻鱼、非对称／侧剃。\n\n> 注：在线站点若更换图片地址，图像可能失效，因此来源文章链接必须保留，便于重新取图。","x":-550,"y":3800,"width":1100,"height":650,"color":"4"}],"edges":[{"id":"edge_title_ponytail_batch01","fromNode":"title_real_subtypes_batch01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"summary_ponytail_batch01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_title_short_batch01","fromNode":"title_real_subtypes_batch01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"summary_short_batch01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_title_curl_batch01","fromNode":"title_real_subtypes_batch01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"summary_curl_batch01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_title_hime_batch01","fromNode":"title_real_subtypes_batch01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"summary_hime_batch01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_title_twintail_batch01","fromNode":"title_real_subtypes_batch01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"summary_twintail_batch01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_title_wolf_batch01","fromNode":"title_real_subtypes_batch01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"summary_wolf_batch01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_title_audit_batch01","fromNode":"title_real_subtypes_batch01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"audit_batch01","toSide":"top"}],"metadata":{"version":"1.0-1.0","frontmatter":{}}}